error[reserved-name] 3:7-3:14
  (defn attempt [x] x)
        ^^^^^^^
  attempt is the name of a form, so it cannot name a function.
  (attempt ...) always means the form, so a function with this name could never be called. A value may be named attempt; a function may not.
  Fix: attempts
  Help: sx help attempt

error[reserved-name] 4:7-4:11
  (let [loop (fn [x] (+ x 1))]
        ^^^^
  loop is the name of a form, so it cannot name a function.
  (loop ...) always means the form, so a function with this name could never be called. A value may be named loop; a function may not.
  Fix: loops
  Help: sx help loop
